{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "671da5ec7183eb9b763b2f57630ed353398ed2c975759a8688115fc25611c523", "ja": "同じフレームに入って", "zh": "放进同一个相框中", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8d53a301d2877916450c3ce547b014be6ab9cadec79967267f959358427f87eb", "ja": "これまでの自分を反省し、練習にも早く来る\nようになった亜利沙。リコッタのメンバーは\n亜利沙の撮った写真を確認する。さらに5人\nのダンスを動画にしてチェックすることで完\n成度を高め、ライブに備えるのだった。", "zh": "亚利沙反省自己过去的缺点，\n练习也开始会提早到了。\n『Ricotta』的成员检视了亚利沙拍的照片，\n并将五个人的舞蹈录下来确认，\n提升了舞蹈的完成度，为演唱会做足了准备。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6810395de8df5e5a3694b10a9a89e8391f60d180c6ce23096508f04713ff8592", "ja": "（今日はリコッタの、公演前最後のレッスン。\nそろそろ集合時間の15分前だが……）", "zh": "（今天是『Ricotta』公演前的最后一次训练课程。\n差不多快到集合时间的15分钟前了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "d64a40cc2c18322b43bbf285cae51b3fd6dc5dd625cabde116ac13b16715fc4f", "ja": "おはようございまーす！", "zh": "早安啊──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "2f267752011f509d1684b81f013c090e8a8444df877da4712a68cc47079a3294", "ja": "おはようっ、みんな！", "zh": "大家早啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "8b80bf4fffc3e25933f2e534609ee024e16e4dbcb89757b73d0deff7eedc291f", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nおはようございます♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n早安♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "e567637b1281e7e3308f2aa1b8e80b5744498989c3ba04b32e52556463734e05", "ja": "おはようございます。\nお兄ちゃんも、おはよう。", "zh": "早安。\n大哥哥也早。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "d31ce11ab04123480531aa34e738dc7d851f939484a69bcfa555061a47e8eb0d", "ja": "おはようございます、今日は最後のレッスンですね！\nありさ、張り切っていきますよ～！　……ムフフ♪", "zh": "早安，今天就是最后的训练课程了呢！\n亚利沙会全力以赴～！……唔呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a9d96d4a5e6f5c6b849d663bda0e32ce40439be78cc5cf97cf87b6f2a73c50da", "ja": "みんな、おはよう。\n全員ちゃんと揃ったな！", "zh": "大家早。\n全部的人都到齐了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "a119926943c233414a33211738abeca4323fcc43d59711a9d6733554017ae1e0", "ja": "……お兄ちゃん。桃子の考えた作戦、\nちゃんとやっておいてくれたんだ？", "zh": "……大哥哥，\n你有确实执行桃子说的战术吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b4a5117e86829847df52bfc84876c37d8b29d6597f5bd8f3541d7c693c885749", "ja": "作戦……ってなんだっけ？", "zh": "战术……你是指什么来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "2b6aaef4db3096b69fdd1cded4ce8ccbb06857bdbd4b873acd3218a4f6182c32", "ja": "え？　決まってるでしょ。亜利沙さんにだけ、\n集合時間を15分早く伝えておくっていう……。", "zh": "咦？这还用问吗？\n就是把告诉亚利沙姊的集合时间，单独提早15分钟……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "0344f42132bfce485f00426a402d17e459d569a42d8de75a7f9e95a8ce5289fe", "ja": "じゃあ、伝えてなかったのにちゃんと来たんだね、\n亜利沙さん。それならそれでいいけど。", "zh": "也就是说，明明没这样告诉她，\n亚利沙姊却还是提早来啰。那样的话是再好不过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1012_p", "source_sha256": "24d3455911f0ed89c167fe8e76a5cbdce6fa849ff73904d922c69d4e08cfb2bc", "ja": "そうだな。そんなことしなくても、\nきっともう大丈夫だから。", "zh": "对呀，现在就算不用那种方法，\n一定也没问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "1729a95fd7fc2077b4bd2af9ed228643c8b17475d2b0587569a86aa920753068", "ja": "……うん。桃子も、ちょっとそう思うかな。\n亜利沙さんのこと、少し見直したかも。", "zh": "……嗯，桃子也有稍微有同感。\n桃子对亚利沙姊有点刮目相看了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "8cbb6fed19404bf03bbe91c1adf88ac52cee802922c75a808c3749275dd76bba", "ja": "それじゃあ今日は、レッスンの前に……\n亜利沙さん、例のアルバムをお願い。", "zh": "那今天在训练课程开始之前……\n亚利沙姊，麻烦你拿那个相簿出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "fbab08df63e1b4ba39665af0da0d4ce913221c62872b7129b6557baed517f444", "ja": "はいっ、桃子ちゃんセンパイ！\nそれでは…ムフフ♪", "zh": "好的，小桃前辈！\n那么……唔呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "11839997e5ea5d836ce57aa5db479000c1efb628625c85d7ad06c4c2f6351c17", "ja": "ありさ秘蔵の『リコッタ・メモリアルスペシャル』、\n心行くまで鑑賞しちゃってくださいね～っ！", "zh": "亚利沙私藏的『Ricotta‧纪念特辑』，\n请尽情观赏～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "8319b50f79be8d65cd45e233856ffc5d86240cb149b7eeeeb8e1dd0f125c23e5", "ja": "勘違いしないでね。アルバムを見るのは、\nダンスの動きを確認するためなんだから。", "zh": "请你不要搞错了，\n看相簿是为了要确认舞蹈动作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "bbf500c870ededbc3cbc56bc88105104218ce9c8a2b3b50d835013bfaae0b591", "ja": "はい、もちろんですっ！\nそれでは、レッスン中の写真から見ていきましょう！", "zh": "嗯，那是当然！\n那就从训练课程的照片开始看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "de9a4277415e911763ecae4938d0bda310957e2921789b34fa118d182b15d86b", "ja": "まず開始の移動ですが、順番を少し変えた方が、\n観客席からの見栄えがいいカモです！", "zh": "首先是一开始的走位，如果稍微改变一下顺序，\n从观众席看过来可能会更有气势！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "23fa72751d657bd617d75cd37f7141dcd1d246fa272be49372a834227f6d5181", "ja": "今のままだと、桃子ちゃんセンパイの姿が、\nちょっぴり隠れちゃうんです……もったいない……。", "zh": "照目前这样，小桃前辈会稍微被挡到……\n这样太可惜了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1021_p", "source_sha256": "533adcc2debf83b6b1f73ebebde212848158ecd9efa210a8dd3984c1ce52cb0c", "ja": "よし、ここは入れ替えよう。他はどうだ？", "zh": "好，那这边就交换一下吧。其他的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "8174119bef5d3afe4f1c659ecb1c196d24f663f8e928134ca762a5992b63b2df", "ja": "次はここです！　記念写真を撮ってるみたいに、\nみんなでピースしてみるのは、どうですかね？", "zh": "接下来是这里！\n如果像拍纪念照一样，大家一起比出Ya的手势如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1023_001har", "source_sha256": "b623bff38c96054a9c57282163f9604208e2877835acc2d409ead61466a5a944", "ja": "わぁ、曲のテーマにも合ってるし、面白そう♪\nみんなで、自分らしいポーズを取るといいかも？", "zh": "哇，跟歌曲的主题也有呼应，感觉会很有趣♪\n大家一起摆出有自己风格的姿势或许也不错喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1024_049mom", "source_sha256": "92d41ffe451f9e9ecbb421c9c28d2d20d63d8c40341add261c2be78bb3e3fe4b", "ja": "……亜利沙さん。", "zh": "……亚利沙姊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1025_028ari", "source_sha256": "e3c3e76a7de8da8005e281dc1ff62054972845370ee4b1bfe65d6e3e5042831b", "ja": "は、はいっ！？　も、桃子ちゃん、\nありさまた調子に乗っちゃってましたかっ！？", "zh": "什、什么事！？\n桃、桃子，亚利沙又太得意忘形了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1026_049mom", "source_sha256": "b7ebc0a437ca1b0c65e643b05040b1738eed1b9c05cb7b004f074a48d5d4aab5", "ja": "ううん、そうじゃなくて。亜利沙さんのアドバイス、\nけっこう参考になったよ。もっと聞きたい……かも。", "zh": "没有，不是的。亚利沙姊的建议很有参考价值，\n桃子可能……还想再多听一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1027_028ari", "source_sha256": "5dd9d67ad659551c50627f4e79c7d92e60696620e02724c8bb9a7fd97c673582", "ja": "も、桃子ちゃんセンパイ……！\nはいっ、もちろんです！　喜んでっ！！", "zh": "小、小桃前辈……！\n好的，当然没问题！亚利沙非常乐意！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1028_001har", "source_sha256": "56b74005db6d7116d722682b94790b7d91af928b2241d1baca3444de703867f9", "ja": "ねえ、亜利沙ちゃん。\nこのカメラって、動画も撮れたりするのかな？", "zh": "问你喔，亚利沙。\n这台相机也可以录影吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1029_028ari", "source_sha256": "4b601fc434cbe89dfda14f8eaae9a1fa39bfa063d0676a2071682976855c978a", "ja": "もちろんです！　フルハイビジョンで、\nアイドルちゃんのどんな動きも見逃しませんっ！", "zh": "当然可以！而且还是Full HD画质，\n不会放过偶像宝贝的一举一动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1030_001har", "source_sha256": "616595c74bcdbf9bfa623ef5ea77f43a28e7d2a5a06808d39f81730b512f73d6", "ja": "じゃあ、私達のダンスレッスン、\n今度は動画で撮ってみない？", "zh": "那我们上舞蹈课程的时候，\n要不要来拍拍看影片？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1031_043nor", "source_sha256": "11c427391dfdf412fe36fd5c0cb756ca749d5bdb3e1b6bd9d039fa8fbfb1c524", "ja": "おっ、いいね！\n変えたところも、すぐ確かめられるしね！", "zh": "哦，这提议不错！\n要是有奇怪的地方，也可以马上做确认！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1032_037nao", "source_sha256": "f6cd9da2c194623cdb91c4b26dcbf65e7dd223bb7a11acc91ee939ff868b0c6b", "ja": "せやけど、亜利沙のカメラやろ？\n亜利沙が抜けると、フォーメーションが……。", "zh": "话是没错啦，但这是亚利沙的相机呀？\n缺了亚利沙的话，表演队型就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1033_028ari", "source_sha256": "9835c58e173cf0382dca28ab6494b2ea432dff3a5e0efe28ec0ffc320b210950", "ja": "大丈夫です！　ありさは、ありさはえーと……\nお、踊りながら撮りますからっ！", "zh": "没问题！亚利沙就、亚利沙就……\n呃……边、边跳边拍！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_1034", "source_sha256": "66ca3480d2f6264cbb89bbd1d3dc3b0df7c767c4941527404cfa8d65cadacb04", "ja": "こら", "zh": "喂！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_2000_p", "source_sha256": "3f36c28545305fa616982506b8a7d5570512eba603c35c74c7d80fa398c0c705", "ja": "いいから、カメラは俺に任せろ。\n亜利沙はみんなと一緒に、練習だ！", "zh": "好了，摄影就交给我吧。\n亚利沙去跟大家一起练习！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_2001_049mom", "source_sha256": "d0305297142318cd80b3819ef597367c5cfc673caaeff48fa22dcb8c1c6c3ea4", "ja": "そうだよ。亜利沙さんが一番できてないんだから、\n一番映らなきゃダメなんじゃないの。", "zh": "就是说嘛，亚利沙姊是表现最差的，\n所以你必须有最多画面才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_2002_028ari", "source_sha256": "63313d7db527344875105276ccbd4a9c895b59bc1b9b468ab9f94f8881fa321f", "ja": "ハッ！？　た、確かにそうでした……！", "zh": "啊！？的、的确是这样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_2003_037nao", "source_sha256": "785f1b65b56fe805bd84dba4b4f2868cbdf3a4171f5d0dd8b7059622b9594e7e", "ja": "あはは、{$P$}さんがカメラマンなら\nよけいに気合い入りそうやんな♪", "zh": "哈哈，如果摄影师是{$P$}先生呀，\n我可能会有点振奋过头嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_2004_043nor", "source_sha256": "97a96b19538566de18b7503cdb636d949df78b6095d20279ca0a15b02285fb5e", "ja": "んじゃ、よろしくねっ、{$P$}！", "zh": "那就麻烦你啰，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_2005_p", "source_sha256": "ed5874e8dad3cbcd1876dbdc172be6bf4bcde0cf2e8432b3b41442120d5ffad8", "ja": "ああ、任せてくれ！", "zh": "嗯，包在我身上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_2006_043nor", "source_sha256": "5780ef315dae8f603cdba02c281a1358a2a222a5ef447b63ae21886a83343410", "ja": "ふぅ～。今のは、結構いい感じだったんじゃない？\n{$P$}、映像見せてっ！", "zh": "呼～刚刚跳的是不是感觉还不错？\n{$P$}，让我看看影片吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_2007_p", "source_sha256": "b18c427db793984c6fa2ff5d25124bb9efb0d0fc275db778b021fc511bf7e163", "ja": "ああ。……よし、これで再生だ。\nどうだ？", "zh": "嗯。\n……好，这样就可以播放了。如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_2008_001har", "source_sha256": "822fbf8fce61aa4f104c9c2134b9f06a76400b39a770c87aa7c2c6d2828b677a", "ja": "う～ん……サビ前のとこ、等間隔で動くのが難しいね。\nのり子ちゃん、歩幅を小さめに意識するといいかも。", "zh": "嗯……进副歌前的部分，动作要保持等间距还真困难。\n法子可能要留意一下不要跨太大步比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_2009_043nor", "source_sha256": "b064aa5c8ea3cae8ffc1fba6754aefb523a96bae9ae0cc54161619f6f980d381", "ja": "お～っ、なるほど……。\nって、奈緒はいくらなんでも小さすぎない？", "zh": "哦～原来如此……\n话说，奈绪的脚步也太小了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_2010_028ari", "source_sha256": "8d8701a7176dbbc03578e032ba475d7761d71c5fffd9edf54c7bc26395589e4a", "ja": "あのぅ……桃子ちゃんセンパイ。\n間奏のとこ、ありさとポジション交代しませんか？", "zh": "那个……小桃前辈。\n间奏的地方要不要和亚利沙换位置？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_2011_037nao", "source_sha256": "2c9bf02fa797aaeda4440a1985b8e3bd54a16f70417002c7dec2606921e7e040", "ja": "亜利沙が前やと、大きい振りのトコで\n桃子が隠れるなぁ。代わった方がええんちゃう？", "zh": "如果亚利沙在前面呀，动作大的地方桃子就被遮住啦。\n换一下位置应该比较好吼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_2012_049mom", "source_sha256": "f7f6247392af3efe0ec9f55a9cf8cb94d70f1ba439eda79e5435893e4b0ec571", "ja": "そうだね、ステージで踏み台は使えないし……\nわかった。亜利沙さんの言うとおりにするよ。", "zh": "说得也是，在舞台上也没办法用垫脚凳……\n桃子知道了，就照亚利沙姊说的做吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_2013_049mom", "source_sha256": "050d4039a1a2878e4b5e00774930eacb61447bac741a572523ea3b1bfa36015a", "ja": "あの……あ、ありがと、亜利沙さん。\n桃子のこと、考えてくれて……。", "zh": "那个……谢、谢谢你，亚利沙姊。\n谢谢你考虑到桃子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_2014_028ari", "source_sha256": "abed8ba17bcaa27d81aa5918a0373bcc5d49720fc62155f5556267ec0766375a", "ja": "ムフフ……♪　桃子ちゃんセンパイの\n「ありがとう」、いただいちゃいました～っ！", "zh": "唔呼呼……♪\n得到了小桃前辈的「谢谢」～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_2015_049mom", "source_sha256": "0fa167c13ba2d5d60efd2dfd60c9569db0f0c00c442abf576361c3c4bc7def79", "ja": "もうっ、からかわないで！\n亜利沙さんのそういうところ、キライ！", "zh": "真是的，不要捉弄桃子啦！\n桃子讨厌亚利沙姊这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_2016_028ari", "source_sha256": "b13e05a8bd4ddf4de958edbedba55fc61755a2bbe0eda6c3eae7ef6c2f4db69d", "ja": "え、ええええっ！！？　ごめんなさい桃子ちゃん、\nありさを、ありさを嫌わないでください～～～っ！", "zh": "咦、咦咦咦咦！！？对不起，桃子。\n请、请不要讨厌亚利沙～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_2017_049mom", "source_sha256": "33db6b2a2b742792be7872254af3795e6bb548711e85cc6dbf96d7ec66399028", "ja": "どうしようかな……。", "zh": "要怎么办好呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_2018_037nao", "source_sha256": "65c8bae493bf605dec4d839c305d79b8e21dbf1e2d7d9bca495ee9e30cc4075d", "ja": "いけずやなぁ……。", "zh": "真是坏心眼啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_2019_p", "source_sha256": "7cc09ee98ad15b5abe03ad04cc6bba2c15f878c93870490941344129f4e899d8", "ja": "（みんな、いい雰囲気だ。\nお互い遠慮なく、自分の意見を言い合っている）", "zh": "（大家的气氛真好。\n彼此之间没有顾虑，互相讨论自己的意见。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_2020_049mom", "source_sha256": "f28ad3b4795474f8ab721033c5306664f3906c8e2c5585bf360c7279874f648e", "ja": "お兄ちゃん、なにニヤニヤしてるの？\n気持ち悪いんだけど……。", "zh": "大哥哥，你为什么在偷笑？\n感觉有点恶心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_2021_p", "source_sha256": "7bb790bb45f6d7a39ab715123608b7f7ecb5105f13b13d5910b398dd5c1766ec", "ja": "うっ……す、すまない。\nそんなつもりじゃなかったんだけど。", "zh": "唔……抱、抱歉，\n我并没有那种意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_2022_001har", "source_sha256": "433611ec4ffb9dce6afc2229124075e8b3f1a7ba79eec1ffe265a6a845dffaf0", "ja": "みんな、もう1本、頭からねっ。\nそれじゃ、あらためて……。", "zh": "大家，我们再从头来一次吧。\n那么让我再说一次……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0018_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0018_story_06_2023_001har", "source_sha256": "df603ac7b61495494b30f880631465b29725d569e0bf64405a637d271f8e7e6b", "ja": "リコッタ、ファイトー！", "zh": "『Ricotta』，Fight──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
